# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in each checkout, whatever
# core.autocrlf says: a file written on Windows doesn't change every line,
# and tests read the same bytes on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte for byte, as they were made: saved sites are as they were
# downloaded (Project Gutenberg's page has CRLF line endings).
tests/sites/** -text
# The forks' patches carry upstream's files' bytes: a file with CRLF line
# endings changed keeps them, or the patch no longer applies.
patches/** -text
